            "connect two vertices when their regions share a boundary segment. "
            "A proper coloring assigns different colors to adjacent regions. "
            "Regions meeting only at a single point need not have different "
            "colors under the usual map-coloring convention. The Four Color "
            "Theorem states that every planar map can be colored with at "
            "most four colors."
        )

    # Squaring the circle.
    if "square circle" in low or "squaring the circle" in low:
        return (
